<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS4.SSS0.Px1" title="In A.4 Theoretical Analysis ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ POME: Post Optimization Model Edit via Muon-style Projection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Problem.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
