<section id="S4.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.4 </span>Commonsense Reasoning</h3>

<div id="S4.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We evaluate POME on commonsense reasoning by fine-tuning LLaMA2-7B and LLaMA3-8B on Commonsense-170k and testing across eight downstream tasks. Table <a href="#S4.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ 4.4 Commonsense Reasoning ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ POME: Post Optimization Model Edit via Muon-style Projection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> presents comprehensive results across diverse reasoning benchmarks.</p>
</div>
